---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | BBTea.sg" description="How BBTea.sg handles browsing, forms, newsletter subscriptions and privacy requests." canonical="https://bbtea.sg/privacy/">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14 space-y-8 text-[var(--color-stone-700)] leading-relaxed">
    <header class="space-y-3"><h1 class="text-4xl font-display font-bold">Privacy policy</h1><p class="text-sm">Last updated: 24 November 2026</p></header>
    <section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold">Who is responsible</h2>
      <p>BBTea.sg is an independent directory of drink shops in Singapore. For questions about this policy or requests concerning your personal information, email <a href="mailto:hello@bbtea.sg" class="underline">hello@bbtea.sg</a>.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold">Browsing the directory</h2>
      <p>You do not need an account. We have removed Google Tag Manager, Google Analytics and the Meta pixel from the site. Those services are no longer loaded by our page templates. Cookies from earlier visits may remain in your browser until they expire or you delete them.</p>
      <p>Cloudflare hosts and protects the site. It processes technical request information such as IP addresses, requested URLs and browser details to deliver pages, prevent abuse and diagnose problems. Cloudflare Web Analytics may also collect performance and usage information through a hosting-provided beacon. Google Fonts receives a request from your browser when a page loads its fonts.</p>
      <p>Directory search runs in your browser using a downloaded search index. Do not include private information in searches or page URLs.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold">Forms and reader reviews</h2>
      <p>Contact, advertising and review forms are provided by Fillout. The form loads only when you choose to open it. At that point, your browser connects to Fillout, which receives technical information and any answers or files you submit. We do not pass the page's query parameters to the form.</p>
      <p>Depending on the form, you may provide your name, email, company, campaign details, message, drink purchase details, ratings and photos. We use these to answer you, consider commercial enquiries, manage corrections and assess reviews for publication.</p>
      <p>A published review can include your chosen display name, purchase details, comments and submitted photos. Your email is not published. Do not upload receipts showing payment details or other people's private information. Contact us if a submission needs to be corrected or removed.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold">Newsletter</h2>
      <p>Newsletter signup is provided by Beehiiv and loads only when you open the signup form. If you subscribe, Beehiiv processes the information you submit to manage the subscription and deliver emails. Its email service may measure delivery, opens and link clicks. We have removed the separate website attribution script. You can unsubscribe using the link in a newsletter.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold">Services that receive information</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-sm text-left border-collapse"><caption class="sr-only">Service providers and their purposes</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col" class="p-3 border-b">Provider</th><th scope="col" class="p-3 border-b">Purpose and privacy information</th></tr></thead><tbody>
        <tr><th scope="row" class="p-3 border-b">Cloudflare</th><td class="p-3 border-b">Hosting, security and performance measurement. <a class="underline" href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare privacy policy</a></td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row" class="p-3 border-b">Google Fonts</th><td class="p-3 border-b">Font delivery. <a class="underline" href="https://developers.google.com/fonts/faq/privacy">Google Fonts privacy information</a></td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row" class="p-3 border-b">Fillout</th><td class="p-3 border-b">Forms and uploads you choose to submit. <a class="underline" href="https://www.fillout.com/privacy">Fillout privacy policy</a></td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row" class="p-3 border-b">Beehiiv</th><td class="p-3 border-b">Newsletter signup and email delivery. <a class="underline" href="https://www.beehiiv.com/privacy">Beehiiv privacy policy</a></td></tr>
      </tbody></table></div>
      <p>These providers may process information outside Singapore. Their policies describe their processing and safeguards. External links, including map and brand websites, connect you to services with their own privacy practices.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold">Advertising</h2>
      <p>Google AdSense advertising is not currently enabled in our page templates. If we enable it, this policy and the relevant consent controls must be updated before ads start loading.</p>
      <p>Google advertising services can use cookies, web beacons, IP addresses and other identifiers to deliver and measure ads, prevent fraud and, where permitted, personalise advertising. Read <a class="underline" href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">how Google uses information from partner sites</a>. A future advertising consent choice will be separate from opening a form or subscribing to the newsletter.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold">Retention and your choices</h2>
      <p>Enquiries and submissions are kept for the time needed to handle them and maintain relevant correspondence or publication records. Provider retention depends on the service and its settings; we do not claim a single retention period for all services. Newsletter subscription information is used until you unsubscribe, subject to delivery, suppression and record-keeping needs.</p>
      <p>You can browse without opening a form or subscribing. Browser settings let you remove or restrict cookies. Under Singapore's Personal Data Protection Act, you may request access to or correction of personal information we hold, or withdraw consent to its use, subject to applicable exceptions. Email hello@bbtea.sg with enough information to identify your submission. We may need to confirm your identity before acting on a request.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold">Children and policy changes</h2>
      <p>This directory is intended for a general audience. Do not submit personal information about a child. Changes to this policy will be shown with a new update date; a policy update does not replace any consent that is required.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
